      "name": "状态和知识点",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status",
      "description": "中文任务状态与中性知识点标签。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-badges\"><span class=\"ds-status\">等待执行</span><span class=\"ds-status ds-success\">已完成</span><span class=\"ds-status ds-warning\">执行失败</span><span class=\"ds-tag\">数的运算</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-badges{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-status,.ds-tag{font-family:\"Geist Variable\",\"Noto Sans SC Variable\",sans-serif;line-height:1.65;display:inline-block;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px;padding:3px 7px;background:var(--accent-soft,#edf2ff);color:#2451bc}.ds-success{background:#edf8f1;color:var(--success,#21724e)}.ds-warning{background:#fff6e4;color:#7b5414}.ds-tag{padding:2px 7px;background:#f0f3f8;color:#52627c}"
    },
    {
      "name": "工作面板",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "surface",
      "description": "白色面板连接标题、说明和内联内容。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-heading\"><h2>阅卷工作台</h2><p>逐题查看作答、参考答案与评分标准。</p></div><div class=\"ds-panel-content\">选择一份学生答卷开始阅卷。</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:\"Geist Variable\",\"Noto Sans SC Variable\",sans-serif;line-height:1.65;font-size:14px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line,#dfe5ee);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);overflow:hidden;color:var(--ink,#202b3d)}.ds-panel-heading{padding:20px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dfe5ee)}.ds-panel-heading h2{margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:600}.ds-panel-heading p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#58657a)}.ds-panel-content{padding:22px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-panel-heading,.ds-panel-content{padding:17px}}"
    },
